      "resolution_rationale": "The observations are referenced at their supplied scope and strength, without adding measurements, statistical results, causal attribution, or extrapolation."
    },
    {
      "dependency_id": "R3K09-C1-D4",
      "subject": "Comparable repeated error counts can support a bounded conclusion of sharply increased error incidence across the tested threshold.",
      "dependency_classification": {
        "content_origin": "SOURCE_SUPPLIED",
