      "materiality_rationale": "This principle supplies the packet's interpretive basis for moving from repeated error counts to the bounded conclusion of sharply increased incidence.",
      "resolution_rationale": "The reference preserves the source's qualified 'can support' relation and tested-threshold limitation; it does not independently assert that the current observations establish the conclusion."
